## Hug collapse ban (unchanged)

Never set `counterAxisSizingMode: "AUTO"` on Recipes A–C hit targets. After `resize()`, re-assert FIXED. No tree-wide hug of all horizontal frames.

## Mandatory verification before shipping chrome

Diff against `4678:13581` (or current selection’s twin first fold):

```
Back/Share/Save: 40×40, radius token === "m", fill === surface/white, stroke === border/default @ 1.5
WhatsApp: 48×48, radius === "m", fill === surface/white, stroke === border/brand
Contact: height 48, radius === "m", fill === surface/brand
```

If Back radius is `full` or `999` → **fail**. Fix to `radius/m` before any other work.  
If gallery icon stroke ≠ **1.5** → **fail**.

